<title>UK: Five Brent dates kept, one clocked.</title>
<headline>Five Brent dates kept, one clocked.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four of the six Brent dates which turned wet on Friday were kept, one was clocked and another deferred, traders said.</p>
<p>Esso kept a Sept 21-23 cargo and deferred another loading Sept 23-25. JP Morgan kept three cargoes loading in a window between September 21-25.</p>
<p>Vitol was clocked with a Sept 21-23 cargo.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4088</p>
